# The pinned ElleKit package, named once and read by both the fetcher and the
# installer. fetch_payloads.sh verifies this digest on download; finalize.sh
# verifies it again immediately before handing the file to dpkg, which runs its
# maintainer scripts as root.
#
# The second check is worth having because the two steps are separate actions:
# `fw finalize` does not rerun the fetch, and the payload it installs sits in a
# mutable work directory in between. It catches a swapped build artifact. It
# cannot defend against someone who can also edit these scripts, and does not
# claim to.
ELLEKIT_VER=1.2
ELLEKIT_SHA=e21dc91bdc1be193dc915daecfff45256239b4fe583a36861e662ab1f43906dc

# ElleKit is by Evelyne Belanger (https://ellekit.space) under a BSD 3-clause
# licence, whose text is device/ELLEKIT-LICENSE: a verbatim copy of the one the
# package ships, so fetch_payloads.sh can compare the two byte for byte and
# refuse a download whose terms changed.
#
# Binary redistribution is permitted provided the notice and disclaimer travel
# with it. finalize.sh installs the package unmodified, so that path carries the
# notice itself. Provisioning installs two dylibs extracted from the package
# without dpkg, so it installs this file beside them for the same reason.
ELLEKIT_LICENSE=ELLEKIT-LICENSE

# mode:path for every regular file the package owns, from the pinned archive:
#   ar p ellekit_1.2_iphoneos-arm64.deb data.tar.xz | xz -dc | tar tvf -
#
# Here rather than read from the archive at check time, because `fw finalize`
# does not fetch payloads: on a fresh work directory there is no deb, and a
# check that sourced its expectations from one skipped every mode silently.
# Measured on device: with the loader at mode 000 and no cached deb, finalize
# reported complete. Keeping the expectation in the repo also means nothing
# builds a device command out of a downloaded archive's member names.
#
# finalize.sh cross-checks this against the archive whenever one is present, so
# bumping the pin cannot leave the table describing the old version.
ELLEKIT_FILE_MODES="
-rw-r--r--:/var/jb/usr/lib/ellekit/MobileSafety.dylib
-rw-r--r--:/var/jb/usr/lib/ellekit/libinjector.dylib
-rw-r--r--:/var/jb/usr/lib/ellekit/pspawn.dylib
-rw-r--r--:/var/jb/usr/lib/libellekit.dylib
-rwxr-xr-x:/var/jb/usr/libexec/ellekit/loader
-rw-r--r--:/var/jb/usr/share/doc/ellekit/LICENSE
"
